    {
      "id": "claim_07dd7cd9be1542d8b60432b674f22e85",
      "statement": "After a created or already-existing PR is returned, open_pull_request best-effort fetches full details, records agent PR usage, upserts normalized PR and legacy metadata on the thread, and, for a Slack code-channel session, refreshes context, agent resource, and the diff view when a nonempty diff is available; any exception in this telemetry sequence is non-fatal to PR creation.",
