      "statement": "PullRequestCreationGuardMiddleware wraps execute/background_execute tool calls and blocks any shell command that would create a PR outside open_pull_request (gh pr create, gh api pulls POST/field, or curl POST to the pulls endpoint), including nested shell commands up to a bounded expansion depth, returning a non-recoverable pr_creation_fallback_blocked error so the real open_pull_request failure is surfaced.",
